units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p

lattice fcc 1.0
region box block 0 5 0 5 0 5 units lattice
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box

mass 1 26.9815

pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * /home/holbrooe/LAMMPS-AST/publication/potentials/prompt1.potential Al

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes

velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes rot no dist gaussian

fix 1 all npt temp 300 300 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1.0

thermo 100
thermo_style custom step temp press etotal

run 10
